      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "うっとり is an onomatopoeic word describing a state of being captivated by beauty.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- うっとりする: to be entranced\n- うっとり{見|み}とれる: to gaze in admiration\n- うっとりするような〜: enchanting (adjective use)\n\nCOMMON TRIGGERS:\n- {美|うつく}しい{景色|けしき} (beautiful scenery)\n- {音楽|おんがく} (music)\n- {香|かお}り (fragrance)\n- {美|び}{人|じん} (beautiful person)",
